+#### `only-active-output`
+
+<sup>Since: next release</sup>
+
+By default, the overview opens on every output. Set `only-active-output=true`
+to limit it to the active output while leaving other outputs unchanged. An
+overview action can override this default with its `all-outputs` property.
+
+```kdl
+overview only-active-output=true {
+}
+
+binds {
+    Mod+O { toggle-overview; }
+    Mod+Shift+O { toggle-overview all-outputs=true; }
+}
+```
+
 #### `backdrop-color`
 
 Set the backdrop color behind workspaces in the overview.
